<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ITT lowered by Salomon.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ITT lowered by Salomon.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it lowered its rating on ITT Corp to buy from strong buy after it received a hostile takeover bid from Hilton Hotels Corp.</p>
<p>-- Salomon maintained a strong buy on Hilton.</p>
<p>-- ITT was up 16 at 58-5/8 and Hilton rose 4-1/2 to 29-3/4.</p>
</text>
